Tarifler recipe data (recipes.txt, installed next to the tarif binary)

The recipes are adapted from two Wikibooks projects by tools/tarif/build-recipes.py:
  * Turkish Wikibooks (Vikikitap), the "Yemek:" namespace — https://tr.wikibooks.org/wiki/Yemek:İçindekiler
  * English Wikibooks Cookbook — https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook:Table_of_Contents
Text by the Wikibooks contributors, licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
licence (CC BY-SA 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Changes: wiki markup removed, ingredient
lists and method steps re-arranged into the app's format, long paragraphs split into steps; tags (soup, dessert,
vegan, …) added from the page categories and the ingredients. The adapted recipes are shared under the same licence.
SOURCES lists the page address and revision of every recipe; the app shows each recipe's address and licence.

Recipes opened online in the app are fetched from the same Wikibooks APIs (same licence) or, only when the user has
entered their own TheMealDB API key, from TheMealDB (https://www.themealdb.com; data and imagery credited to
TheMealDB; its free test key "1" is for development and educational use only, public apps need a supporter key).
They are kept on the device in data/tarif/cache.txt for offline use.
